- `db-example`: `point-in-time-restore` (not offered by `Managed Database for PostgreSQL and MySQL`)
- `db-zone-example`: `zone-high-availability` (not offered by `Managed Database for PostgreSQL and MySQL`)
- `fn-ipv6-example`: `ipv6` (not offered by `Serverless Functions`)
- `partial-example`: `node-high-availability` (not offered by `Instances`)

